WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:05.240
In Song dynasty China, a short verse
summed up what Zen claims to be.

2
00:00:05.290 --> 00:00:09.230
It calls Zen a special transmission
outside the scriptures,

3
00:00:09.280 --> 00:00:12.030
not founded on words and letters.

4
00:00:12.080 --> 00:00:14.880
Yet Zen has a huge literature of its own:

5
00:00:14.930 --> 00:00:17.360
the Blue Cliff Record, the Gateless Gate,

6
00:00:17.410 --> 00:00:18.650
and many more.

7
00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:21.560
So if awakening cannot be put into words,

8
00:00:21.610 --> 00:00:24.230
why does Zen have so many books?

9
00:00:24.280 --> 00:00:27.040
In this mission, you'll sit
in on seated meditation,

10
00:00:27.090 --> 00:00:30.960
and meet the koan: a
puzzle reason cannot solve.

11
00:00:31.010 --> 00:00:34.250
Then you'll compare Zen's
two great schools in Japan,

12
00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:36.120
Rinzai and Soto.

13
00:00:36.170 --> 00:00:40.960
Your mission: find out why a school
beyond words still fills its shelves with

14
00:00:41.010 --> 00:00:41.640
books.
